OAuth

Write the story `oauth`: the `User` uses the `App` with the label `sign in`,
the `App` sends the `User` back with the label `redirect`, the `User` goes to
the `Identity provider` with the label `log in`, the `Identity provider` sends
to the `App` with the label `code`, and the `App` calls the `Identity provider`
with the label `trade code`. Show it as a sequence.
---
story oauth {
  User -> App: sign in
  App -> User: redirect
  User -> Identity provider: log in
  Identity provider -> App: code
  App -> Identity provider: trade code
}
show sequence of oauth
